Harbor setup (src/harbor_setup), AGPL-3.0-only.

Third-party code and assets it builds with or ships:

- borealis, XITRIX fork (https://github.com/XITRIX/borealis, commit 8c1f1093ee41a461d9d3bdd6dd2f6dfec166ab7a),
  Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). Copyright 2019-2021 natinusala, 2021-2023 xfangfang, XITRIX and other
  borealis contributors. Downloaded at build time (cpmfile.json "borealis") with the changes in .patch/borealis.
  Built with it: nanovg (zlib, Mikko Mononen), stb_image and stb_truetype (public domain / MIT, Sean Barrett),
  fontstash (zlib), Yoga (MIT, Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates), tweeny (MIT), tinyxml2 (zlib, Lee Thomason),
  libretro-common (MIT). Borealis' own resources (Nintendo system fonts, images) are not used or shipped.
- Noto Sans Regular 2.015 (resources/NotoSans-Regular.ttf), SIL Open Font License 1.1 (resources/OFL.txt).
  Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors.
- The Android Java helpers org.libsdl.app.PlatformUtils and BorealisHandler (src/android) come from borealis'
  android-project, Apache-2.0.

The setup's flow, pages, strings, horn cue and Harbor mark follow the Ryujinx Harbor (MIT-licensed Ryujinx base).
No firmware, keys, console fonts, icons or sounds are included.
